---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="醫學計算器" description="教育用途的公式計算工具。">
  <main class="tool-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">CALCULATORS</p>
    <h1>醫學計算器</h1>
    <p>輸入資料後會顯示結果與單位。公式供學習使用，不能替代臨床判斷；請確認輸入條件、單位與適用情境。</p>
    <div class="callout"><strong>資料保護：</strong>此頁不會傳送輸入值；此原型不會保存個案資料。請勿輸入患者可識別資訊。</div>
    <section class="calculator-grid">
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h2>Anion Gap</h2><p>AG = Na⁺ − Cl⁻ − HCO₃⁻，不含 K⁺。</p>
        <form data-calculator="anion-gap">
          <label>Na⁺ (mEq/L)<input name="sodium" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>Cl⁻ (mEq/L)<input name="chloride" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>HCO₃⁻ (mEq/L)<input name="bicarbonate" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <button type="submit">計算 AG</button><output aria-live="polite" data-result></output>
        </form>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h2>Albumin-corrected Anion Gap</h2><p>修正 AG = AG + 2.5 × (4 − albumin)，albumin 單位 g/dL。</p>
        <form data-calculator="corrected-anion-gap">
          <label>Na⁺ (mEq/L)<input name="sodium" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>Cl⁻ (mEq/L)<input name="chloride" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>HCO₃⁻ (mEq/L)<input name="bicarbonate" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>Albumin (g/dL)<input name="albumin" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <button type="submit">計算修正 AG</button><output aria-live="polite" data-result></output>
        </form>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h2>A–a Oxygen Gradient</h2><p>PAO₂ = FiO₂ × (PB − 47) − PaCO₂/R；A–a = PAO₂ − PaO₂。預設 PB=760 mmHg、R=0.8。</p>
        <form data-calculator="aa-gradient">
          <label>FiO₂ (比例，例如 0.21)<input name="fio2" type="number" min="0.21" max="1" step="any" value="0.21" required /></label>
          <label>PaCO₂ (mmHg)<input name="paCO2" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>PaO₂ (mmHg)<input name="paO2" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <button type="submit">計算 A–a</button><output aria-live="polite" data-result></output>
        </form>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h2>Arterial Oxygen Content (CaO₂)</h2><p>CaO₂ = 1.34 × Hb × SaO₂ + 0.003 × PaO₂。SaO₂ 輸入百分比。</p>
        <form data-calculator="cao2">
          <label>Hemoglobin (g/dL)<input name="hemoglobin" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>SaO₂ (%)<input name="saturation" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>PaO₂ (mmHg)<input name="paO2" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <button type="submit">計算 CaO₂</button><output aria-live="polite" data-result></output>
        </form>
      </article>
      <article class="tool-card">
        <h2>Oxygen Delivery (DO₂)</h2><p>DO₂ = CO × CaO₂ × 10；CO 單位 L/min、CaO₂ 單位 mL O₂/dL。</p>
        <form data-calculator="do2">
          <label>Cardiac output (L/min)<input name="cardiacOutput" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <label>CaO₂ (mL O₂/dL)<input name="oxygenContent" type="number" step="any" required /></label>
          <button type="submit">計算 DO₂</button><output aria-live="polite" data-result></output>
        </form>
      </article>
    </section>
    <h2>待新增</h2><p>Creatinine-based eGFR、Creatinine Clearance 與 ABG 判讀輔助工具，需先完成公式適用條件、來源與邊界案例查核。</p>
  </main>
  <script>
    import { calculatorDefinitions } from '../../lib/calculators.js';
    document.querySelectorAll('form[data-calculator]').forEach((form) => {
      form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
        event.preventDefault();
        const output = form.querySelector('[data-result]');
        const definition = calculatorDefinitions[form.dataset.calculator];
        try {
          const values = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());
          const result = definition.calculate(values);
          if (!Number.isFinite(result)) throw new RangeError('請檢查輸入數值與單位。');
          output.textContent = `結果：${result.toFixed(2)} ${definition.unit}`;
          output.className = 'result';
        } catch (error) {
          output.textContent = error.message || '輸入值無效，請檢查後重試。';
          output.className = 'error';
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
